==Strategy==
While it may be tempting to use your new Legend Cat [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Mewtone]] here, the Mr. Mole and Hackey severely discourage this, although he's still pretty good at the start for the first Red EnerG. Instead, you can revert back to how you might treat almost any mono-Red stage and spam [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] with a bunch of Research [[Cat Combo]]s. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can deal with the second Red EnerG, and what's left of the stage at this point is cleaned up by a bunch of Couriers and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cats]].

